---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { AFFILIATE, SITE } from '../config';
---
<Base title="Affiliate disclosure" description={`How ${SITE.name} uses affiliate links.`}>
  <div class="plain">
    <div class="page-head"><h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1><p>How we make money from recommendations, and what it does not change.</p></div>
    <p>{AFFILIATE.disclosure}</p>
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Some articles include a "Recommended" block linking to a retailer. If you buy after following one, the retailer may pay us a commission. You pay the same price.</li>
      <li>Those links are marked as sponsored in the page code, and every block carries this disclosure next to it.</li>
      <li>We decide what to recommend first and look for a link second. A product is not recommended because it pays.</li>
      <li>A price is shown only with the date we checked it. Prices change: confirm on the retailer's page.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>What it does not affect</h2>
    <p>News, discoveries and explainers are not influenced by commercial relationships. Sponsored content, if we ever run any, will be labelled as sponsored at the top.</p>
    {!AFFILIATE.enabled && <p class="empty">Affiliate links are not active on the site at the moment.</p>}
  </div>
</Base>
